              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "बेलणो (belṇo) is inherited from Sanskrit vellayati, \"causes to shake, kneads\"; CDIAL lists Hindi belnā, \"to roll out\" (CDIAL 12121). CDIAL gives no Marwari form in this entry. The rolling pin, बेलण, is its tool."
